      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "From the initial scoping of the project to install solar and battery system, PDR representatives were very helpful, polite and honest. The person who did the initial visit explained the different options for solar panels and batteries, helped me in locating the best location for the battery, explained the process and answered all my questions. The quote was sent to me immediately with a couple of options to choose from including the data sheets of the products for me to investigate and consider in making my decision.During the installation day, the young men who arrived to do the job were polite and explained the scope of work to me. They were tidy. Although they encountered some challenges as my house is double storey, which delayed completion of the job. They needed to come back two more times to finish the job and get the system working. Although I saw that they did their job with care, I noticed some scuff marks on my walls and ceiling in the garage and even inside the house  (by the stairs) as they needed to bring a ladder to access the second storey ceiling.The battery was installed on the first day. It looked really neat and tidy with the Gateway sitting above the battery. I was impressed with the workmanship. However, an error was made in the install of the battery. They completed the install with one battery module more than required. This meant that they had to remove one extra battery module the following day thus exposing the conduits and the holes on the wall, making the battery set-up looking less tidy. The app was also set-up with the extra battery module, which still needed to be updated.Despite all the challenges and the amount of work that the team needs to do in other job sites, they went back to address the remaining issues to be able to get the solar and battery system up and running. I'm thankful for their commitment to complete the job at my house even if it meant returning outside their normal working hours.",
