      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Quoting process and salesperson was fantastic. Got a number of quotes to compare which was top notch. Prices offered were by far the best in class (in comparison to other established companies)Installation had a hiccup with installing of a not so common but already quoted inverter feature however it was quickly and efficiently sorted out. Also there is an accidental hole/damage to the interior wall which is yet to be fixed by them (was a bit hurt by this as this is a brand new house with no such damages yey). No major complains apart from that and the office was easy to reach out for any questions at any time.The peak performance of the system however has not been reaching according to the quoting proposal which has been brought up but I am waiting for more days/data to really escalate it. Finally the panel layout on the quote vs the install was different probably due to circumstances but I was not told on the install day (or any day) and I only noticed this being different after a week as my panels are normally not visible at all due to completely being on the neighbors side. The install was very neat and clean and no major complains there too.Grid connection and meter change was organised by them. Have I mentioned about the price yet because the price they offered was by far the best (by a lot) compared to the rest.Overall happy with PDR Energy and hoping to get continued support in the future from them - have also already recommended them to a number of my friends",
